# Build context of python.Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore first).
# Allow-list style: everything is excluded, then only what the image needs is added back.
# NEVER add back secrets/, .env*, or data/ - they are mounted read-only at run time.
**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!libs/**
!scripts/synth/**
!services/**
!infrastructure/docker/healthcheck.py
# excluded again inside the allowed trees
services/service-catalog
**/tests
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/secrets
**/.env*
**/data
